# FeedbackOps (713p2): products/feedbackops/.gitignore의 경로 고정 항목 (앱이 apps/fo-*로 이동)
# TanStack Router generated route tree
# Pre-bundled Drizzle schema consumed by drizzle-kit (apps/platform-api/scripts/bundle-schema.mjs)
apps/platform-api/.drizzle-schema/
# Unanchored entries of the old file, kept at every depth under the FO apps and packages (the platform has its own rules)
apps/platform-api/**/.vite
apps/feature-screens/**/.vite
apps/platform-api/**/report/
apps/feature-screens/**/report/
apps/platform-api/**/coverage
apps/feature-screens/**/coverage
apps/platform-api/**/build
apps/feature-screens/**/build
apps/platform-api/**/*.log
apps/feature-screens/**/*.log
apps/platform-api/**/smoke-*.png
apps/feature-screens/**/smoke-*.png
apps/platform-api/**/visual-*.png
apps/feature-screens/**/visual-*.png
packages/feature-shared/**/.vite
packages/feature-ui/**/.vite
packages/feature-shared/**/report/
packages/feature-ui/**/report/
packages/feature-shared/**/coverage
packages/feature-ui/**/coverage
packages/feature-shared/**/build
packages/feature-ui/**/build
packages/feature-shared/**/*.log
packages/feature-ui/**/*.log
# The bridge entry `@fops/frontend/operator-screens/coverage` (#762 c) is source, not a test-coverage report.
!apps/feature-screens/src/operator-screens/coverage/
# .env files of the old file, at every depth under the FO apps and packages (.env.example stays tracked)
apps/platform-api/**/.env
apps/feature-screens/**/.env
apps/platform-api/**/.env.local
apps/feature-screens/**/.env.local
apps/platform-api/**/.env.*.local
apps/feature-screens/**/.env.*.local
apps/platform-api/**/.env.release
apps/feature-screens/**/.env.release
packages/feature-shared/**/.env
packages/feature-ui/**/.env
packages/feature-shared/**/.env.local
packages/feature-ui/**/.env.local
packages/feature-shared/**/.env.*.local
packages/feature-ui/**/.env.*.local
packages/feature-shared/**/.env.release
packages/feature-ui/**/.env.release

# FeedbackOps docs (713p3): products/feedbackops/.gitignore의 남은 항목 중 docs/.llmwiki/만 새 경로로 옮겼다.
# 나머지(.claude/settings.json·.codegraph/·.playwright-mcp/·agent-workflow 심볼릭 링크·minio_data/)는 그 폴더 안에서만 뜻이 있었다.
docs/feedbackops/.llmwiki/

# Any .env anywhere (examples stay tracked)
**/.env
!**/.env.example
